Hi {Owner},

I build websites for hair salons and suite stylists around {City}. {Business Name} has beautiful hair work on its social pages, but no site where a new client can see prices and book.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a priced hair menu, a colour consultation form, a first-visit guide to the suite and a booking button, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and menu changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone between clients?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
